<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26003" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lātĭo</span></b> ,
		ōnis, f.
		fero, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a bearing, bringing</i> (only in the trop. signif.). *
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auxilii,</span>”
				<i>a rendering of assistance</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 2,
					33</span></i>
			. 1.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			In partic. (cf. fero). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			Suffragii latio, <i>a voting</i> or <i>right of voting</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 9, 43</span></i>, 
			 24; 38, 36, 7; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">45, 15, 3: legis latio,</span>”
				<i>a proposing of a law, a bill</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 3, 26</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Expensi latio, <i>a setting down of
				expenditures, entering of money paid</i>, <i><span class="en">Gell. 14,
				2, 7</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
